WEBVTT

00:00:08.943 --> 00:00:10.467
[ HERMIONE SCREAMING ]

00:00:12.904 --> 00:00:14.688
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:00:14.732 --> 00:00:16.342
OH, OH, OH.

00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:18.518
AH!
DOBBY?

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:20.781
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:23.436
DOBBY HAS COME TO RESCUE
HARRY POTTER, OF COURSE.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.873
DOBBY WILL ALWAYS BE THERE
FOR HARRY POTTER.

00:00:25.917 --> 00:00:28.180
ARE YOU SAYING YOU CAN APPARATE
IN AND OUT OF THIS ROOM?

00:00:28.224 --> 00:00:29.790
COULD YOU TAKE US WITH YOU?

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:31.575
OF COURSE, SIR.
I'M AN ELF.

00:00:31.618 --> 00:00:34.534
WORKS FOR ME.

00:00:34.578 --> 00:00:36.754
RIGHT. DOBBY, I WANT YOU TO
TAKE LUNA AND MR. OLLIVANDER.

00:00:36.797 --> 00:00:39.583
SHELL COTTAGE
ON THE OUTSKIRTS OF TINWORTH.

00:00:39.626 --> 00:00:40.845
TRUST ME.

00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:43.108
WHENEVER YOU'RE READY,
SIR.

00:00:43.152 --> 00:00:46.416
"SIR"?
I LIKE HER VERY MUCH.

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:54.467
MEET ME AT THE TOP OF THE STAIRS
IN TEN SECONDS.

00:00:54.511 --> 00:00:56.165
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:01:01.518 --> 00:01:03.433
[ GRUNTS ]

00:01:03.476 --> 00:01:04.912
OW.

00:01:04.956 --> 00:01:06.784
[ THUD ]

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:13.138
WHO GETS HIS WAND?

00:01:15.836 --> 00:01:20.145
Bellatrix: I AM ONLY GOING TO
ASK YOU ONCE MORE, GOBLIN.

00:01:20.189 --> 00:01:23.496
THINK VERY, VERY CAREFULLY
BEFORE YOU ANSWER.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.455
Griphook:
I DON'T KNOW.

00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:28.675
YOU DON'T KNOW?
WHY WEREN'T YOU DOING YOUR JOB?

00:01:28.719 --> 00:01:32.201
WHO GOT INTO MY VAULT?

00:01:32.244 --> 00:01:34.681
WHO STOLE IT?

00:01:34.725 --> 00:01:36.727
WHO STOLE IT?!

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.207
WELL?

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:42.124
WHEN I WAS LAST IN YOUR VAULT,
THE SWORD WAS THERE.

00:01:44.474 --> 00:01:48.130
OH, WELL, THEN, PERHAPS IT JUST
WALKED OUT ON ITS OWN, THEN.

00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:50.697
THERE IS NO PLACE SAFER
THAN GRINGOTTS.

00:01:50.741 --> 00:01:52.264
LIAR!

00:01:53.787 --> 00:01:57.051
CONSIDER YOURSELF LUCKY,
GOBLIN.

00:01:57.095 --> 00:01:58.531
[ BLOWS ]

00:01:59.967 --> 00:02:03.493
THE SAME WON'T BE SAID
FOR THIS ONE.

00:02:03.536 --> 00:02:04.581
LIKE HELL!

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:07.366
EXPELLIARMUS!

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:09.890
[ GRUNTS ]
STUPEFY!

00:02:13.938 --> 00:02:15.766
Bellatrix: STOP!

00:02:15.809 --> 00:02:18.160
DROP YOUR WANDS.

00:02:20.292 --> 00:02:22.076
I SAID, DROP 'EM!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.600
[ WANDS CLATTER ]

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.819
PICK THEM UP,
DRACO, NOW!

00:02:25.863 --> 00:02:29.823
WELL, WELL, WELL.
LOOK WHAT WE HAVE HERE.

00:02:29.867 --> 00:02:31.608
[ BREATHING RAGGEDLY ]

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.131
IT'S HARRY POTTER.

00:02:33.175 --> 00:02:37.091
HE'S ALL BRIGHT AND SHINY
AND NEW AGAIN,

00:02:37.135 --> 00:02:40.225
JUST IN TIME
FOR THE DARK LORD.

00:02:40.269 --> 00:02:42.401
CALL HIM.
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.538
CALL HIM!

00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:04.293
[ GLASS TINKLING ]

00:03:04.336 --> 00:03:06.077
[ GASPS ]

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.470
[ SQUEAKING ]

00:03:13.606 --> 00:03:15.391
AAAH!

00:03:16.479 --> 00:03:19.830
[ BOTH GRUNTING ]

00:03:22.963 --> 00:03:25.357
STUPEFY!
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:25.401 --> 00:03:27.490
Bellatrix:
STUPID ELF!

00:03:27.533 --> 00:03:29.100
YOU COULD'VE KILLED ME!

00:03:29.143 --> 00:03:30.797
DOBBY NEVER MEANT
TO KILL.

00:03:30.841 --> 00:03:34.888
DOBBY ONLY MEANT TO MAIM OR...
SERIOUSLY INJURE.

00:03:35.628 --> 00:03:37.064
[ GASPS ]

00:03:37.108 --> 00:03:40.590
HOW DAREYOU TAKE
A WITCH'S WAND?!

00:03:40.633 --> 00:03:42.809
HOW DARE YOU DEFY
YOUR MASTERS?!

00:03:42.853 --> 00:03:47.161
DOBBY HAS NO MASTER.

00:03:47.205 --> 00:03:49.729
DOBBY IS A FREE ELF.

00:03:49.773 --> 00:03:53.298
AND DOBBY HAS COME
TO SAVE HARRY POTTER

00:03:53.342 --> 00:03:54.821
AND HIS FRIENDS!

00:03:54.865 --> 00:03:57.346
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:04:03.874 --> 00:04:06.572
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:04:11.142 --> 00:04:13.884
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:04:13.927 --> 00:04:16.408
[ HARRY BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:04:23.807 --> 00:04:25.461
HERMIONE...

00:04:25.504 --> 00:04:27.506
[ SNIFFLES ]
...YOU'RE ALL RIGHT.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.116
WE'RE SAFE.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.293
WE'RE ALL SAFE.

00:04:31.336 --> 00:04:35.166
Dobby: [ Weakly ]
HARRY POTTER.

00:04:37.734 --> 00:04:41.128
DOBBY...

00:04:41.172 --> 00:04:44.523
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:04:44.567 --> 00:04:46.482
[ GASPING ]

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:52.052
DOBBY.
NO, JUST...

00:04:52.096 --> 00:04:53.402
HOLD ON.

00:04:53.445 --> 00:04:55.404
HOLD ON. LOOK.

00:04:55.447 --> 00:04:57.928
JUST HOLD ON, OKAY?

00:04:57.971 --> 00:05:00.409
WE'LL -- WE'LL FIX YOU.

00:05:00.452 --> 00:05:03.020
HERMIONE WILL...HAVE SOMETHING.

00:05:03.063 --> 00:05:04.674
IN YOUR BAG.

00:05:04.717 --> 00:05:05.805
HERMIONE!

00:05:07.285 --> 00:05:08.808
[ Voice breaking ]
HERMIONE.

00:05:08.852 --> 00:05:12.290
HERMI-- HE'S...

00:05:12.334 --> 00:05:14.988
HELP ME!

00:05:16.512 --> 00:05:19.166
SUCH A BEAUTIFUL PLACE...

00:05:21.865 --> 00:05:24.258
...TO BE WITH FRIENDS.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.046
DOBBY IS HAPPY...
[ CRYING ]

00:05:29.089 --> 00:05:31.483
...TO BE
WITH HIS FRIEND...

00:05:31.527 --> 00:05:33.659
[ SOBS ]

00:05:33.703 --> 00:05:36.358
...HARRY POTTER.

00:05:55.594 --> 00:05:56.943
[ SNIFFLES ]

00:05:56.987 --> 00:05:59.685
WE SHOULD
CLOSE HIS EYES.

00:05:59.729 --> 00:06:01.383
DON'T YOU THINK?

00:06:06.257 --> 00:06:08.694
THERE.

00:06:08.738 --> 00:06:10.479
NOW HE COULD BE
SLEEPING.

00:06:10.522 --> 00:06:13.046
[ SOBS ]

00:06:25.319 --> 00:06:29.019
I WANT TO BURY HIM...

00:06:29.062 --> 00:06:31.195
PROPERLY...

00:06:31.238 --> 00:06:33.415
WITHOUT MAGIC.

00:06:48.473 --> 00:06:52.216
[ SHOVEL SCRAPING ]

00:09:16.012 --> 00:09:19.189
[ MID-TEMPO MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:11:25.837 --> 00:11:28.797
[ UP-TEMPO MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:12:34.819 --> 00:12:38.388
[ SLOW MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:14:54.654 --> 00:14:58.267
[ DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:15:30.212 --> 00:15:32.997
[ TEMPO INCREASES ]

00:16:19.957 --> 00:16:22.786
[ UP-TEMPO MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:18:29.913 --> 00:18:33.134
[ SLOW MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:52.648
[ MID-TEMPO MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:20:29.424 --> 00:20:33.424
[ MUSIC ENDS ]

